 "captions": [
  {
   "t0": 0.07999999999999999,
   "t1": 1.56,
   "text": "For years, I watched creators play"
  },
  {
   "t0": 1.56,
   "t1": 3.44,
   "text": "the craziest Minecraft challenges."
  },
  {
   "t0": 3.44,
   "t1": 4.68,
   "text": "The floor is lava."
  },
  {
   "t0": 4.68,
   "t1": 6.44,
   "text": "Every block drops something random."
  },
  {
   "t0": 6.44,
   "t1": 7.96,
   "text": "One heart for the whole game."
  },
  {
   "t0": 7.96,
   "t1": 9.78,
   "text": "And every time, I thought: why can't"
  },
  {
   "t0": 9.78,
   "t1": 11.009999999999998,
   "text": "I just *play* this myself?"
  },
  {
   "t0": 11.315958333333334,
   "t1": 12.655958333333334,
   "text": "So in April twenty twenty-five,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 12.655958333333334,
   "t1": 13.635958333333335,
   "text": "I wrote the first few challenges"
  },
  {
   "t0": 13.635958333333335,
   "t1": 15.635958333333335,
   "text": "into a mod. Then came more."
  },
  {
   "t0": 15.635958333333335,
   "t1": 17.135958333333335,
   "text": "A timer, a challenge picker,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 17.135958333333335,
   "t1": 18.035958333333333,
   "text": "a level tree with XP,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 18.035958333333333,
   "t1": 19.975250000000003,
   "text": "until there were *fifty* of them."
  },
  {
   "t0": 19.975250000000003,
   "t1": 21.095250000000004,
   "text": "Then I went further."
  },
  {
   "t0": 21.095250000000004,
   "t1": 21.51525,
   "text": "A whole casino,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 21.51525,
   "t1": 23.435250000000003,
   "text": "where the House always wins."
  },
  {
   "t0": 23.435250000000003,
   "t1": 25.175250000000002,
   "text": "And now I'm teaching an AI called Bob"
  },
  {
   "t0": 25.175250000000002,
   "t1": 27.28525,
   "text": "to play Lockout Bingo against you."
  },
  {
   "t0": 27.452708333333337,
   "t1": 28.57270833333334,
   "text": "It's called Challenge Craft,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 28.57270833333334,
   "t1": 29.792708333333337,
   "text": "it's free on CurseForge,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 29.792708333333337,
   "t1": 31.482708333333335,
   "text": "and this is only the *beginning*."
  }
 ],
